wski, Andrzej","orcid":"0000-0003-0532-2685","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.scico.2013.06.003","issn":["01676423","18727964"],"issn_org":["01676423"],"journal":"Science of Computer Programming","pages":"106-128","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Science of Computer Programming","volume":"83"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84894584009"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-93c73daa-66b4-4701-ab30-8e9d967daf89","itu-c31c0a4e-62a9-4ca4-900d-3e7b0e4a83f4"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A modal specification theory for components with data","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-087.88-007153","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Specification theories for real-time systems allow reasoning about interfaces and their implementation models, using a set of operators that includes satisfaction, refinement, logical and parallel composition. To make such theories applicable throughout the entire design process from an abstract specification to an implementation, we need to reason about the possibility to effectively implement the theoretical specifications on physical systems, despite their limited precision. In the literature, this implementation problem has been linked to the robustness problem that analyzes the consequences of introducing small perturbations into formal models. We address this problem of robust implementations in timed specification theories. We first consider a fixed perturbation and study the robustness of timed specifications with respect to the operators of the theory. To this end we synthesize robust strategies in timed games. Finally, we consider the parametric robustness problem and propose a counter-example refinement heuristic for computing safe perturbation values.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Legay, Axel","Traonouez, Louis-Marie","Wasowski, Andrzej"],"cuid":["S02-093.75-008464"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["France"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Irisa/INRIA Rennes","The French National Institute for Computer Science (INRIA)"],"keyword":["Implementation","Real time systems","Robustness","Specification theory","Stepwise refinement","Timed I O automata","Timed games"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"robust synthesis for real time systems","src":["aau","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tcs.2013.08.015","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-093.75-008464","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000330913500005","type":"wos"},{"id":"84890122615","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-afb8a350-b1ae-434f-9bf7-a2ca8057dc85","itu-50ab0a3f-e757-4809-93c7-27a1c95a9278"],"keyword":["Implementation","Real-Time Systems","Robustness","Specification Theory","Stepwise refinement","Timed Games","Timed I/O automata"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-430556C709C31DB2A5611FCD2745C4F2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tcs.2013.08.015","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, CISS - Center for Embedded Software Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed Systems and Semantics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fr","key":"irisa inria rennes","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Irisa/INRIA Rennes","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"fr","key":"the french national institute for computer science","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"The French National Institute for Computer Science (INRIA)","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU