{"author_count":7,"contributors":["Berger, Thorsten","Rublack, Ralf","Nair, Divya","Atlee, Joanne M.","Becker, Martin","Czarnecki, Krzysztof","Wasowski, Andrzej"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383886"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a survey of variability modeling in industrial practice","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84874005301","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383886","identifier":[{"id":"84874005301","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-b3f5ac80-9078-40bd-917e-8059999b9e79"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FBB13B20463146B441A533A8DC0E353D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["The Department, Software & Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thorsten","key":"bergerpau","last":"Berger","name":"Berger, Thorsten","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ralf","key":"rublackpau","last":"Rublack","name":"Rublack, Ralf","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Divya","key":"nairpau","last":"Nair","name":"Nair, Divya","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Joanne M.","key":"atleepau","last":"Atlee","name":"Atlee, Joanne M.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"beckerpau","last":"Becker","name":"Becker, Martin","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Krzysztof","key":"czarneckipau","last":"Czarnecki","name":"Czarnecki, Krzysztof","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrzej","key":"wasowskipau","last":"Wasowski","locid":"a39b94ff-e1b6-4b96-8404-486167a9123d","name":"Wasowski, Andrzej","orcid":"0000-0003-0532-2685","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9781450315418"],"publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"VaMoS '13 Proceedings of the Seventh International Workshop on Variability Modelling of Software-intensive Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84874005301"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-b3f5ac80-9078-40bd-917e-8059999b9e79"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Survey of Variability Modeling in Industrial Practice","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383886","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"The channel capacity of a deterministic system with confidential data is an upper bound on the amount of bits of data an attacker can learn from the system. We encode all possible attacks to a system using a probabilistic specification, an Interval Markov Chain. Then the channel capacity computation reduces to finding a model of a specification with highest entropy. Entropy maximization for probabilistic process specifications has not been studied before, even though it is well known in Bayesian inference for discrete distributions. We give a characterization of global entropy of a process as a reward function, a polynomial algorithm to verify the existence of an system maximizing entropy among those respecting a specification, a procedure for the maximization of reward functions over Interval Markov Chains and its application to synthesize an implementation maximizing entropy. We show how to use Interval Markov Chains to model abstractions of deterministic systems with confidential data, and use the above results to compute their channel capacity. These results are a foundation for ongoing work on computing channel capacity for abstractions of programs derived from code.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Biondi, Fabrizio","Legay, Axel","Nielsen, Bo Friis","Wąsowski, Andrzej"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-305166"],"event":{"acronym":"LATA","end":"2013-04-05","place":"Bilbao, es","start":"2013-04-02","title":"7th International Conference on Language and Automata Theory and Applications (LATA 2013)","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["France"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","French National Institute for Computer Science and Applied Mathematics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"maximizing entropy over markov processes","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-37064-9_13","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-305166","identifier":[{"id":"84875654273","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-0214e6fa-c74a-4b33-81a3-57fc0780f791"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-253C9CC8A79C3259E7D0EB25BAAA0F1F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-37064-9_13","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fr","key":"french national institute for computer science and applied mathematics","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"French National Institute for Computer Science and Applied Mathematics","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Statistics and Data Analysis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Fabrizio","key":"biondipau","last":"Biondi","name":"Biondi, Fabrizio","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Axel","key