{"abstract":"Recently, we have proposed a new design theory for timed systems. This theory, building on Timed I/O Automata with game semantics, includes clas- sical operators like satisfaction, consistency, logical composition and structural composition. This paper presents a new efficient algorithm for checking Büchi objectives of timed games. This new algorithm can be used to strengthen the in- finite behavior of an interface, or to guarantee that the interface can indeed be implemented. We illustrate the framework with an infrared sensor case study.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Bourke, Timothy","David, Alexandre","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Legay, Axel","Lime, Didier","Nyman, Ulrik","Wasowski, Andrzej"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-108728"],"event":{"acronym":"WADT","end":"2010-07-04","start":"2010-07-01","title":"20th International Workshop on Algebraic Development Techniques WADT 2010","year":"2010"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","France"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","INRIA/IRISA, Rennes Cedex, France","IRCCyN Ecole Centrale Nantes"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"new results on timed specifications","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/58769014/ownWADT2010.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-108728","identifier":[{"id":"84857740549","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ca334ead-b4fd-417e-9aeb-08e20e7bda66"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-619BFE8C9F798A70F32AC9FA69052F97"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/1