of Copenhagen"],"title":"Cross-Language Support Mechanisms Significantly Aid Software Development","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-381762","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
