{"abstract":"We recently introduced Abstract Probabilistic Automata (APA), a new powerful abstraction formalism for probabilistic automata. Our theory is equipped with a series of aggressive abstraction techniques for state-space reduction as well as a specification theory for both logical and structural comparisons. This paper reports on the implementation of the approach in the Abstract Probabilistic Automata Checker toolset.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Delahaye, Benoît","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Legay, Alex","Pedersen, Mikkel Larsen","Wasowski, Andrzej"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-117009"],"event":{"end":"2011-09-08","place":"Aachen, de","start":"2011-09-05","title":"8th International Conference on Quantitative Evaluation of Systems","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["France"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","INRIA/IRISA Rennes"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"apac a tool for reasoning about abstract probabilistic automata","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/QEST.2011.28","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-117009","identifier":[{"id":"80055051221","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e66195f8-3795-4658-b6a3-194847d75c4f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-82216470AB6ACB5B26AAAFE7F234CC7C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/QEST.2011.28","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fr","key":"inria irisa rennes","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"INRIA/IRISA Rennes","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg